    v5.1.5 - Fix cache update_at for tbl_expedisi & fix Sisa value not updating
    
    - Add update_at field to BarcodeSessionRecord for cache invalidation
    - Implement cache validation using update_at timestamp from Supabase
    - Fix Sisa (remaining) value not updating after scan in BarcodeInputFragment
    - Add proper thread management for UI updates (Dispatchers.IO and Main)
    - Add 100ms delay after scan to ensure cache sync before UI refresh
    - Enhanced logging for debugging expedition summary calculation
    - Add documentation: EXPEDISI_CACHE_UPDATE_AT_IMPLEMENTATION.md
    - Add documentation: FIX_SISA_UPDATE_ISSUE.md
    - Update version to 5.1.5 (build 20)

